572
00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.416
Sin atajos.

573
00:11:32.416 --> 00:11:33.333
Sin mimos.

574
00:11:33.333 --> 00:11:34.958
Acéptalo o arrástrate de vuelta a

575
00:11:34.958 --> 00:11:35.708
